OL,3,GNEWSAHow hope is helping communities
OL,4,Abuild for the future
OL,5,
OL,6,F"Hope is something that spurs us into
OL,7,Faction," says chartered psychologist Dr
OL,8,FAudrey Tang.
OL,10,FFrom arts programmes in Poole to
OL,11,Fhigh-street regeneration in
OL,12,FBournemouth, some communities in Dorset
OL,13,Fsay they are trying to use hope to
OL,14,Finspire change.
OL,16,FBBC Politics South has been asking what
OL,17,Frole hope plays in culture, employment
OL,18,Fand town and city regeneration.
OL,23,APub: 13-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
