OL,3,GNEWSAHow hope is helping communities
OL,4,Abuild for the future
OL,5,
OL,6,FTang says: "What creates hope is three
OL,7,Fthings: goal-setting, a pathway to
OL,8,Freach the goal and determination to go
OL,9,Ffor it."
